rapidocr-core 0.2.2 from https://github.com/White-NX/rapidocr-rs
License: Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE).

Lunchpail extensions add MIGraphX and CoreML provider selection, fixed-shape
MIGraphX inference and warm-up support, plus a provider probe example. The
remaining source is from the published rapidocr-core 0.2.2 crate.
